      "extract": "of the Kazhdan-Lusztig basis. This chapter deﬁnes the p-canonical basis, describing how it is computed in practice by use of the local intersection form. The chapter presents examples that demonstrate how it diﬀers from the Kazhdan-Lusztig basis, and the advantages of the diagrammatic Hecke category over Soergel bimodules in positive characteristic. The chapter ﬁnally indicates the relation of the p-canonical basis",
